## 🔒 Audit Sécurité

### Conformité SECURITY.md ✅

| Règle | Status | Validation |
|-------|--------|------------|
| Auth sur chaque action | ✅ | `requireAuth()` + `getUserContext()` partout |
| Guild isolation | ✅ | `guildConfig.id` (CUID) dans toutes les queries |
| RBAC check mutations | ✅ | `requireBonusManage()` pour purchase/cancel |
| Input validation Zod | ✅ | `purchaseBonusSchema`, `cancelBonusSchema` |
| No raw SQL | ✅ | Prisma ORM exclusivement |
| No secrets client-side | ✅ | Pas de `process.env` exposé |
| No eval/exec | ✅ | Aucune exécution dynamique |

### Détails des Checks

**purchaseBonus()**
```typescript
const validated = purchaseBonusSchema.parse({ guildId, bonusType, ... });
const userId = await requireAuth();
await requireBonusManage(validated.guildId); // ✅ RBAC check

const guildConfig = await db.guildConfig.findUnique({
    where: { discordGuildId: validated.guildId }
});

const existingBonus = await db.guildBonus.findFirst({
    where: {
        guildId: guildConfig.id, // ✅ Guild isolation (CUID)
        bonusType: validated.bonusType,
        status: { in: [BonusStatus.PURCHASED, BonusStatus.ACTIVE] }
    }
});
```

**cancelBonus()**
```typescript
const validated = cancelBonusSchema.parse({ bonusId, guildId });
await requireBonusManage(validated.guildId); // ✅ RBAC check

const guildConfig = await db.guildConfig.findUnique({
    where: { discordGuildId: validated.guildId }
});

const bonus = await db.guildBonus.findUnique({
    where: { id: validated.bonusId }
});

if (bonus.guildId !== guildConfig.id) { // ✅ Guild isolation check
    return { success: false, error: "Ce bonus n'appartient pas à votre guilde" };
}
```

